<h3 style="text-align: left;">Welcome to<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Enhanced Virtual Education</strong></h3>
<p style="text-align: left;">Here are some&nbsp;important tools you'll need for EVE:</p>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td width="50%">
<h4>LTCC Email</h4>
</td>
<td width="50%">
<h4>Zoom</h4>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="vertical-align: top;">
<p>All college communications will be sent to your LTCC email address. <span>LTCC Email link can be updated to be Office 365 portal. </span></p>
<p>Access to all web-based apps and download options are available in the portal.</p>
<p><a title="Login to your LTCC email" href="https://portal.office.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Login to Your Email &rarr;</a></p>
</td>
<td style="vertical-align: top;">
<p>LTCC employees frequently use Zoom for virtual meetings. New employees can setup their own free Zoom account using Single Sign On.</p>
<p><a style="font-size: inherit; text-align: center; background-color: #fffdfd;" title="Zoom installation instructions" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/virtual_campus/zoom_instructions.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">New Employee Zoom Information &rarr;</a></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
